## 🛕 Section 2 — Most Visited Places of Uttarakhand

These are the destinations that put Uttarakhand on the map. High footfall, solid infrastructure, and a reason to visit for almost every kind of traveler — families, pilgrims, honeymooners, and weekend escapers.

This section also includes all **four Char Dham sites** — the most sacred pilgrimage circuit in Uttarakhand. Every year, lakhs of devotees make this journey. In 2026, online registration is mandatory and slots fill up fast.

---

